<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

    <header class="bg-primary text-white text-center py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4">Upper Lake (Bhojtal)</h1>
            <p class="lead">A historic and vital freshwater lake in the heart of Bhopal</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container my-5">
        <img src="https://natureworldwide.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG-20210514-WA0035.jpg"
            class="hero-img rounded mb-4" alt="Upper Lake Bhopal">

        <section>
            <h2>History</h2>
            <p>Upper Lake, also called Bhojtal, was built in the 11th century by Raja Bhoj, the Parmar king of Malwa.
                According to legend, the lake was created when the king constructed a dam across the Kolans River to
                heal a skin ailment. The lake has served as a source of life and culture in Bhopal for centuries.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-4">
            <h2>Geography and Significance</h2>
            <p>Spanning more than 31 square kilometers, Upper Lake is Bhopal’s largest water body and a major source of
                drinking water for the city. It is interconnected with the Lower Lake, and together they form the Bhoj
                Wetland, which is a designated Ramsar site. The lake is bordered by hills and greenery and supports
                diverse flora and fauna.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-4">
            <h2>Activities and Attractions</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Boating:</strong> Available at the Boat Club with paddle boats, speed boats, and cruise
                    rides.</li>
                <li><strong>Van Vihar National Park:</strong> Situated next to the lake, this open zoo and wildlife
                    sanctuary offers views of both wildlife and the lake.</li>
                <li><strong>Sunset Point:</strong> The lakeside promenade is a popular spot for stunning sunset views
                    and evening walks.</li>
                <li><strong>Local Delicacies:</strong> Numerous stalls and cafés offer street food and traditional
                    snacks by the lakeside.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-4">
            <h2>Environmental Importance</h2>
            <p>Bhojtal plays a crucial role in maintaining the city's ecological health. It supports groundwater
                recharge, regulates temperature, and provides habitat for migratory birds. Conservation efforts are
                ongoing to control pollution and protect its biodiversity.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-4">
            <h2>Gallery</h2>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                    <img width="300" height="300"
                        src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQedfI3UzzibEnSeG31GRxKpo9jceJwvK4Jsg&s"
                        class="img-fluid rounded" alt="View from Van Vihar">
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                    <img width="300" height="300"
                        src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTjVq4rvE216k7hCa8FdIP0ep9tyMiL4YoPRA&s"
                        class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Upper Lake boating">
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                    <img width="300" height="300" src="https://www.touristplaces.net.in/images/pp/7/p141644.jpg"
                        class="img-fluid rounded" alt="Boat Club at Upper Lake">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

  <section class="mt-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="mb-4">User Reviews</h2>

        <!-- Review Form -->
        <form action="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review" method="POST" id="reviewForm" class="mb-5">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="mb-3 col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
                    <label for="reviewRating" class="form-label">Rating</label>
                    <select name="rating" class="form-select" id="reviewRating" required>
                        <option value="" disabled selected>Select rating</option>
                        <option value="5">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Excellent</option>
                        <option value="4">⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Very Good</option>
                        <option value="3">⭐⭐⭐ - Good</option>
                        <option value="2">⭐⭐ - Fair</option>
                        <option value="1">⭐ - Poor</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3 col-12">
                    <label for="reviewText" class="form-label">Your Review</label>
                    <textarea name="comment" class="form-control" id="reviewText" rows="4" required></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Review</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>

        <!-- Reviews List -->
        <div id="reviewsList">
            <% if (reviews.length === 0) { %>
                <p class="text-muted">No reviews yet. Be the first to write one!</p>
            <% } %>
            <div class="row ">
                <% reviews.forEach(review => { %>
                    <div class="singleReview card col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3 mb-4 mx-md-1 ">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h4 class="card-title"><%= review.author.username %></h4>
                            <p class="card-text"><%= review.comment %></p>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                <%= '⭐'.repeat(review.rating) %> 
                            </p>

                            <!-- Edit and Delete Buttons -->
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-start">
                                <a href="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review/<%= review._id %>/edit" class="btn btn-outline-primary mx-2">Edit</a>
                                <form method="POST" action="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review/<%= review._id %>?_method=DELETE" >
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger">Delete</button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
